: A new reality in medicine. I. Recent developments</article-title><source>Arch Intern Med</source><volume>150</volume><fpage>1811</fpage><lpage>1818</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2203320</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040119-b010"><citation citation-type="other"><collab>Global Programme on Evidence for Health Policy</collab><year>2003</year><source>Guidelines for WHO guidelines</source><comment>World Health Organization. Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://whqlibdoc.who.int/hq/2003/EIP_GPE_EQC_2003_1.pdf">http://whqlibdoc.who.int/hq/2003/EIP_GPE_EQC_2003_1.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 5 April 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040119-b011"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group><name><surname>Guyatt</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayward</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Richardson</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Moving from evidence to action</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Guyatt</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rennie</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><comment>editors</comment><source>Users' guide to the medical literature: A manual for evidence-based clinical practice</source><publisher-loc>Chicago</publisher-loc><publisher-name>AMA Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040119-b012"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Sch&#x000fc;nemann</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Munger</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Brower</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Donnell</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Crowther</surname><given-names>M</given-name